        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, I inclined to award future loss of income at Rs.16,000/ X 12 X 13 X 23% =Rs.5,74,080/\nwhich is the total loss of future income."
